{"title":"MIMC","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Masters Invitational Math Contest</b>, or <b>MIMC</b> is an annual math competition hosted on AoPS by several South Carolinians.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Format\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Format</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Difficulty\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Difficulty</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Scoring\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Scoring</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Time_Limit\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Time Limit</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Challenges\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Challenges</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#MIMC_Committee\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MIMC Committee</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Previous_Contests/Results\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Previous Contests/Results</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#MIMC_I:_2006_Spring_Test\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MIMC I: 2006 Spring Test</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Format\">Format</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Format\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Discussion is hosted in the South Carolina Forum.  The MIMC is given twice a year, and is open to all AoPS members.  The contest is written by Sean, Shobhit, and Joe, with additional contributions from many others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Difficulty\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Difficulty\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The contest will be 50 questions, multiple choice, ranging from National MathCounts to upper level AIME difficulty. We would like every AoPSer to participate, but do not be discouraged by harder problems towards the end. Although we encourage middle-schoolers to participate, middle schoolers are not expected to be able to anwer the higher numbered questions. \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scoring\">Scoring</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Scoring\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each correct answer will earn 5 points, a question left blank will earn 1 point, and an incorrect answer will earn 0 points. Scores will range from 0 - 250.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Time_Limit\">Time Limit</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Time Limit\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Due to our inability to accurately track time participants will have four weeks to turn in answers.  An extension MAY be given if more participants are needed.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Challenges\">Challenges</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Challenges\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before we send out scores and compile results, I will post the answer key here. Any challenged should be PMed to MIMC Director, and our team will review the challenge, and tell you the result. After 3 days, the challenge window will be closed, and results will be posted, and scores sent out.  All challenges will be decided by the MIMC Committee.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MIMC_Committee\">MIMC Committee</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: MIMC Committee\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The MIMC Committee currently consists of:\n</p><p><b>MIMC Director</b> - coordinates contest, but is a shared account, and does not vote\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Iversonfan2005\" title=\"User:Iversonfan2005\">Shobhit V.</a> - Problem Writer, Co-Director\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Mysmartmouth&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Mysmartmouth (page does not exist)\">Sean S.</a> - Problem Writer, Co-Director, TeXer\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Joml88&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Joml88 (page does not exist)\">Joe Laurendi</a> - Problem Writer, Proofer\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Arkmastermind\" title=\"User:Arkmastermind\">Asif K.</a> - Proofer\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Elemmnop&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Elemmnop (page does not exist)\">Seva T.</a> - Problem Writer, Proofer\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Altheman\" title=\"User:Altheman\">Alex K.</a> - Problem Writer, Proofer\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Previous_Contests.2FResults\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Previous_Contests/Results\">Previous Contests/Results</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Previous Contests/Results\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that only the Top 16 Individuals are posted, the rest of the scores are sent to the test-taker via Private Message.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MIMC_I:_2006_Spring_Test\">MIMC I: 2006 Spring Test</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIMC&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: MIMC I: 2006 Spring Test\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?mode=attach&amp;id=3973\">Problems</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?mode=attach&amp;id=3972\">Rules</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=88651\">Results</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=88650\">Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072536\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 30/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/20971